ctx←connectionClientContext con;r;vals
⍝ Fetch client context from connection handle
⍝ con: duckdb_connection pointer
⍝ ctx: duckdb_client_context pointer (destroy with destroyClientContext)

r←api.duckdb_connection_get_client_context con 0
vals←,r
ctx←⊃vals
:If 1<≢vals
    :If ~∧/vals=ctx
        ctx←¯1↑vals
    :EndIf
:EndIf
